  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>Now solving all options one by one we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>Which is not a tautology</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Tautology</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p>Which is not a tautology</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi></math></p><p>Which is not a tautology</p>"
